{"about_the_game":"Have you ever dream to sit in your isolated room and contemplate your broken mind? Yeah... This game won't help you cure it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a simulation of how bad a person reacts to isolation. It may be scary, it contains horror elements, but the point is to experience a mind going wild in the isolated space.<br />\r\nThis is only a prototype, not a full vertical slice of a game. The whole thing should take you no more than 20 minutes, you may experience weird noises, anxiety and mirages.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd one thing more, the experience can be different for each individual. Do not panic.<br />\r\nIf you feel dizzy or you experience rising heartbeat, please turn off this game by simple tapping Escape button.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1338430?t=1758029806","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338430/f56509b60c26c07ab1d453b45d923ac6c804fb09/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758029806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338430/21714c2cf16e2a886fe8433395903abfcd40cf73/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758029806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1338430/21714c2cf16e2a886fe8433395903abfcd40cf73/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758029806","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"It's a horror, it can be scary, expect flickering light, monsters, maybe jump-scares and creepy voices."},"detailed_description":"Have you ever dream to sit in your isolated room and contemplate your broken mind? Yeah... This game won't help you cure it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a simulation of how bad a person reacts to isolation. It may be scary, it contains horror elements, but the point is to experience a mind going wild in the isolated space.<br />\r\nThis is only a prototype, not a full vertic